  "schema_version": 1,
  "instrument": "Rigol DHO804, firmware 00.01.05, SCPI over raw TCP port 5555",
  "purpose": "Differential capture of the factory K-99695 Saturn valve bus at the valve connector, idle and through one outlet start and stop, plus the connector's meter readings. See README.md.",
  "controller_contact": "No HTTP requests before 18:38 UTC. Then six, serialised and at least 5 s apart: values.cgi 18:38:31, quick_shower.cgi 18:40:02, system_info.cgi 18:40:22, stop_shower.cgi 18:40:29, system_info.cgi 18:40:50 and 18:42:26. The scope only listened to the bus.",
  "probing": "CH1 on pin 4, CH2 on pin 3, both 10x, grounds on pin 2",
